{"parentUuid": null, "uuid": "a0010001-0000-4000-8000-000000000000", "type": "user", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T09:00:00.000Z", "message": {"role": "user", "content": "\u00dc\u00e7 depoda s\u00fcr\u00fcm \u00e7\u0131karaca\u011f\u0131z, nereden ba\u015flayal\u0131m?"}, "sessionId": "a0010001", "cwd": "/workspace", "version": "2.1.274", "gitBranch": "main", "userType": "external", "isSidechain": false}
{"parentUuid": "a0010001-0000-4000-8000-000000000000", "uuid": "a0010001-0000-4000-8000-000000000001", "type": "assistant", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T09:03:00.000Z", "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "S\u0131ra \u00f6nemli: \u00f6nce ortak k\u00fct\u00fcphane deposu, sonra servis, en son istemci. Her birinde dal a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131yor, s\u00fcr\u00fcm hanesi elle y\u00fckseltiliyor, build al\u0131n\u0131p do\u011frulan\u0131yor."}]}, "sessionId": "a0010001", "cwd": "/workspace", "version": "2.1.274", "gitBranch": "main", "userType": "external", "isSidechain": false}
{"parentUuid": "a0010001-0000-4000-8000-000000000001", "uuid": "a0010001-0000-4000-8000-000000000002", "type": "user", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T09:06:00.000Z", "message": {"role": "user", "content": "Tamam, k\u00fct\u00fcphanede dal\u0131 a\u00e7t\u0131m ve haneyi y\u00fckselttim. S\u0131radaki?"}, "sessionId": "a0010001", "cwd": "/workspace", "version": "2.1.274", "gitBranch": "main", "userType": "external", "isSidechain": false}
{"parentUuid": "a0010001-0000-4000-8000-000000000002", "uuid": "a0010001-0000-4000-8000-000000000003", "type": "assistant", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T09:09:00.000Z", "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Servis deposunda ayn\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 yap, sonra istemcide. K\u00fct\u00fcphanenin build'i ye\u015fil olmadan servise ge\u00e7me."}]}, "sessionId": "a0010001", "cwd": "/workspace", "version": "2.1.274", "gitBranch": "main", "userType": "external", "isSidechain": false}
{"parentUuid": "a0010001-0000-4000-8000-000000000003", "uuid": "a0010001-0000-4000-8000-000000000004", "type": "user", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T09:12:00.000Z", "message": {"role": "user", "content": "\u00dc\u00e7\u00fc de bitti, build'ler ye\u015fil."}, "sessionId": "a0010001", "cwd": "/workspace", "version": "2.1.274", "gitBranch": "main", "userType": "external", "isSidechain": false}
{"parentUuid": "a0010001-0000-4000-8000-000000000004", "uuid": "a0010001-0000-4000-8000-000000000005", "type": "assistant", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T09:15:00.000Z", "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "S\u00fcr\u00fcm i\u015fi tamam. \u00dc\u00e7 depoda da dallar a\u00e7\u0131k, haneler y\u00fckseltildi ve build'ler ge\u00e7ti."}]}, "sessionId": "a0010001", "cwd": "/workspace", "version": "2.1.274", "gitBranch": "main", "userType": "external", "isSidechain": false}
